 "notes": "Tables 3-4 (Icorr, IE, fitted EEC parameters) are not in the packet; the Icorr/Rct numbers and the CPEdl n trend behind MEC n13 are text-only. No figure shows lawsone in the coating (FTIR of PCL-LS equals PCL, o6), so n10 is argued and qualified. Branches: (1) hydroxide + PCL barrier + lawsone -> corrosion resistance -> 7-day immersion protection; (2) lawsone -> antibacterial. F7c not cited (OCR cue XRD). Packet defects: F10/F11 are paper Figs 11/10 (order swapped); F6/F7 captions garbled and F7 caption describes Nyquist plots but image shows Bode plots of 1-7 d immersion; F2, F4, F5, F11 captions garbled; F8 row labels cropped off; F8 0 d panels reuse F2A-D images.",
 "review": {
  "judge": "senior investigator",
